In the results: Enter plays the release here. Shift+Enter opens its page in the browser, Ctrl+Enter its download page, Ctrl+Shift+Enter the artist page.=U rezultatima: Enter pušta izdanje ovde. Shift+Enter otvara njegovu stranicu u pregledaču, Ctrl+Enter stranicu za preuzimanje, Ctrl+Shift+Enter stranicu izvođača.
F5 previous track, F6 play or pause, F7 next track, F8 stop. The media keys work too.=F5 prethodna pesma, F6 pusti ili pauza, F7 sledeća pesma, F8 stop. Rade i medijski tasteri.
Left and right arrows rewind and fast forward 5 seconds, with Shift 30 seconds.=Strelice levo i desno premotavaju 5 sekundi, uz Shift 30 sekundi.
The title bar shows what is playing.=Naslovna traka pokazuje šta svira.
Finds releases on Bandcamp by country and genre, filters them by name, plays them in Bandcamp's own embedded player and opens them on Bandcamp in your browser.=Traži izdanja na Bandcampu po državi i žanru, filtrira ih po imenu, pušta ih u Bandcampovom ugrađenom plejeru i otvara ih na Bandcampu u tvom pregledaču.
It uses only what Bandcamp allows: its Discover service and the embedded player. Nothing is downloaded by the program.=Koristi samo ono što Bandcamp dozvoljava: servis Discover i ugrađeni plejer. Program sam ništa ne preuzima.
Country list: GeoNames, CC BY 4.0. Browser engine: Microsoft Edge WebView2.=Spisak država: GeoNames, CC BY 4.0. Pregledač: Microsoft Edge WebView2.
